{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f8492481044257679deee63cbc73fe695f9e3429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = |x - 4|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51aa7135b15db8e5680adbc6531dd006203fcad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) - f(4) - f(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/7781677468ba7b6b770e61ee1762a5bc9f55140d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  -3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  -1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  1 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  3 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"429\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> represents the positive distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/0478720e3af73128fb5d75aeba9f8c3d35bfc892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155e035678573d0f724280b7d0c185de53444e31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f8cc85badcf99ddcbaf6f0f017f3f80ad484237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f50e92d115d842d9ce0dee8926d2c35ec3fbec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) - f(4) - f(5) = 2 - 0 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"245\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0eb8e35a1ea28ff27edbcb0c5af00343ba68510e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/8659d147c3605eeea76d32510e2d2576660e356e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Prob